# The Hinterlands (48-49): the Horde quests of Revantusk Village, Quel'Danil and Jintha'Alor, for a
# Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/the_hinterlands_48_49.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (The Hinterlands, area 47).
# The guide's quest list is section 12 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md.
# Carried in: The Atal'ai Exile (1429, Fel'zerul in Stonard), Testing the Vessel (3123, Uzer'i in
# Feralas: its wildkin are here, it is handed in by Feralas & Un'Goro Crater (49-50)), Whiskey Slim's
# Lost Grog (580, Booty Bay: its bottles are here, it is handed in by a later guide), Return to
# Apothecary Zinge (864) and Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient (2641), both from Gadgetzan in Tanaris &
# Dustwallow Marsh (47-48). The Ancient Egg (4787) is left out: it follows a Zul'Farrak quest.
# Added: Recover the Key! (7846): Elder Torntusk gives it between Kidnapped Elder Torntusk! and
# Return to Primal Torntusk, which needs it (the allocation left it out as repeatable).
# Left out: Battle of Warsong Gulch (8428), Conquering Arathi Basin (8437) and Conflict at Darkspear
# Islands (98889): they want battleground Marks of Honor, won in PvP battlegrounds, not by questing.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (Ripple Recovery, the auction house), the zeppelin to Undercity, a flight to
# Tarren Mill and the ride in; Revantusk Village; one long loop north along the coast, through the
# wilds and Skulk Rock, west to Quel'Danil and back by the Altar of Zul; a flight to Tarren Mill, the
# Final Message at Aerie Peak, Shadra'Alor and Jintha'Alor; the OOX robot and Rin'ji's secret; then
# Tarren Mill, Undercity, Booty Bay, Orgrimmar, Sen'jin and Gadgetzan to hand everything in.

guide The Hinterlands (48-49)
faction horde
levels 48 49
carry 580 650 864 1122 1429 2641 2874 3123 3444
leave 81 580 1122 1444 2874 3123 3444 3568
next Feralas & Un'Goro Crater (49-50)

# Undercity -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Undercity
ah 7842.1 npc 8672
accept 3568
tip Seeping Corruption is done much later, in Azshara and Felwood & Winterspring (54-56): keep its empty vials.
tip Otho in Revantusk wants 10 of these feathers later. Buying them saves farming gryphons at a one-in-three drop rate.
turnin 864
tip Apothecary Zinge works in the Apothecarium.
accept 2995
tip Oran Snakewrithe stands in the Magic Quarter.
fly "Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad" npc 4551

# Into the Hinterlands --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map The Hinterlands
turnin 650
tip From Tarren Mill take the road east past Durnholde Keep up into the Hinterlands. Aerie Peak, the Wildhammer town by the road, is hostile: ride past it. Gilveradin camps by the road east of it.
accept 77

