do 580 bg
tip Whiskey Slim's Pupellyverbos Port: small bottles on the beaches either side of Revantusk. Booty Bay wants them in a later guide.
do 7840
tip Lard's picnic basket is on the island off the north coast. Vilebranch Kidnappers guard it.
do 7815
tip The Saltwater Snapjaws crawl along the whole coast between Revantusk and the island.
